ORIGIN
------

This project is a fork of the Ray Optics Simulation. It adds a wave optics
simulator, which solves for light as a complex scalar field rather than as
rays, and an assignment system built on top of both simulators. The ray optics
simulator it was forked from is still present and still works.

The whole of this project, inherited and new alike, is distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy is in the LICENSE file.


